---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { languages, type Lang } from '../../../../data/profile';
import { lumabough, topics } from '../../../../data/lumabough';
export function getStaticPaths() { return languages.map(lang => ({ params: { lang } })); }
const lang=Astro.params.lang as Lang; const zh=lang==='zh';
---
<Layout lang={lang} title="LumaBough · 光枝" description={lumabough.summary[lang]} path="projects/lumabough/">
<section class="wrap project-intro"><a class="back-link" href={'/'+lang+'/projects/'}>← {zh ? '全部作品' : 'All projects'}</a><div class="project-title lumabough-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / RENDERING ENGINEERING</p><h1>LumaBough<span class="title-period">.</span></h1></div><span class="badge">MIT · {lumabough.tag}</span></div><div class="project-description"><h2>{zh ? '光枝：从帧构建到资源生命周期' : 'From frame construction to resource lifetimes'}</h2><p class="lede">{lumabough.summary[lang]}</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#demo">{zh ? '观看双后端演示' : 'Watch both backends'} ↓</a><a class="button button-outline" href={lumabough.repo}>GitHub ↗</a><a class="button button-outline" href={lumabough.release}>{zh ? '预览版与下载' : 'Preview & downloads'} ↗</a></div><p class="video-note">{zh ? 'MiniEngine 的独立公开作品库；展示名称为 LumaBough，内部命名与程序名保留 MiniEngine。项目借助 Agent 推进实现、验证与文档整理，本页不将协作产出表述为纯手工独立实现。' : 'The independent public portfolio repository for MiniEngine. LumaBough is the public name; internal names and executables retain MiniEngine. Agents assisted implementation, verification, and documentation; collaborative output is not presented as entirely manual solo work.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap project-facts" aria-label={zh ? '项目概况' : 'Project overview'}><div><span class="eyebrow">PLATFORM</span><strong>Windows x64 / C++20</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">BACKENDS</span><strong>D3D11 / D3D12</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE</span><strong>RenderPacket / Render Graph</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">DELIVERY</span><strong>{zh ? '源码 · 演示 · 证据' : 'Source · Demos · Evidence'}</strong></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="engineering"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING FOCUS</p><h2>{zh ? '理解边界，再组织一帧。' : 'Understand the boundaries. Build the frame.'}</h2></div></div><div class="lumabough-topics">{topics.map((item,i)=><article><p class="eyebrow">0{i+1}</p><h3>{item.title[lang]}</h3><p>{item.text[lang]}</p></article>)}</div><p class="video-note">{zh ? '上述为源码设计导览，不能替代每项能力的运行证据。' : 'This is a source-design overview, not a substitute for runtime evidence for each capability.'} <a href={lumabough.source+'docs/architecture/README.md'}>{zh ? '查看模块、帧流程与所有权图' : 'Module, frame, and ownership diagrams'} ↗</a></p></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="demo"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DYNAMIC DEMOS</p><h2>{zh ? '两个后端，同一组边界事件。' : 'Two backends. The same boundary events.'}</h2></div></div><p class="lede">{zh ? '两个独立进程分别展示尺寸变化、零尺寸暂停与恢复，以及 shader 候选接受或拒绝后继续渲染。视频使用固定场景与事件字幕，关注状态变化而非复杂场景效果。' : 'Separate processes demonstrate resizing, zero-size suspension and restoration, and continued rendering after shader candidate acceptance or rejection. A fixed scene and event captions make state changes the focus.'}</p><div class="lumabough-demos">{['d3d11','d3d12'].map(backend=><article><h3>{backend.toUpperCase()}</h3><div class="video-frame"><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1920" height="1080" poster="/media/lumabough/render-preview.png" aria-label={backend.toUpperCase()+(zh ? ' 动态演示' : ' dynamic demonstration')} aria-describedby="demo-note"><source src={'/media/lumabough/lumabough-demo-'+backend+'.mp4'} type="video/mp4" /><a href={'/media/lumabough/lumabough-demo-'+backend+'.mp4'}>{zh ? '打开视频' : 'Open video'}</a></video></div></article>)}</div><p class="video-note" id="demo-note">{zh ? '视频按帧与事件推进，来自公开 Release，保持原文件字节。演示的是程序化 RHI 事件，不是 OS 最小化、文件监听热更新、自由相机或实时性能测量；两个后端分别运行，不是进程内切换。封面是较早的固定场景预览，并非视频抽帧。' : 'The frame- and event-driven demos are mirrored byte-for-byte from the public Release. They show programmatic RHI events, not OS minimization, file-watcher hot reload, a free camera, or real-time performance measurement. Backends run separately, not via an in-process switch. The poster is an earlier fixed-scene preview, not a video frame.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="evidence"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">RESULTS & LIMITS</p><h2>{zh ? '可复核，也保留未获支持的结论。' : 'Reviewable results, including unsupported gains.'}</h2></div></div><div class="lumabough-topics"><article><h3>{zh ? '运行包验证' : 'Runtime package validation'}</h3><p>{zh ? '预览运行包面向 Windows 10/11 x64 的 m4-visual-baseline 场景，包含 D3D11 与 D3D12。上游记录了第二台机器独立运行；真实读者走查延期，不能由“运行通过”推定易用性。' : 'The preview runtime supports m4-visual-baseline on Windows 10/11 x64 with D3D11 and D3D12. Upstream records independent execution on a second machine. Reader walkthroughs were deferred; successful execution does not establish usability.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/CANDIDATE-REVIEW.md'}>{zh ? '运行范围与候选验证' : 'Runtime scope and candidate review'} ↗</a></article><article><h3>{zh ? '性能实验：不宣称当前加速' : 'Performance: no current speedup claim'}</h3><p>{zh ? 'lb-current-004：单机 D3D12、关闭 VSync，5 种配置各 5 次运行，每次 600 个测量帧。四项比较为 1 INCONCLUSIVE + 3 REJECTED，无 ACCEPTED。公开证据包可复算，但不代表预览运行包 v8 的性能；历史加速声明的源码身份缺口仍保留。' : 'lb-current-004: one machine, D3D12, VSync off, five configurations with five runs each and 600 measured frames per run. Four comparisons yielded 1 INCONCLUSIVE and 3 REJECTED, with no ACCEPTED result. Public data supports recomputation, but does not measure the v8 runtime package; historical speedup claims retain their source-identity gap.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/PERFORMANCE-EVIDENCE-PACK.md'}>{zh ? '协议、数据与结论' : 'Protocol, data and conclusions'} ↗</a></article></div><p class="video-note">{zh ? '范围：Vulkan 未实施；设备丢失不承诺自动恢复；glTF 导入是受限子集。不是完整编辑器或通用商业引擎，瞬态池内存稳定也不等于进程零泄漏。本站未重新运行引擎或性能实验。' : 'Scope: Vulkan is not implemented; device-loss recovery is not guaranteed; glTF import supports a limited subset. This is not a full editor or general-purpose commercial engine, and stable transient-pool memory does not mean a leak-free process. This website has not rerun the engine or its experiments.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap contact-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">SOURCE & ATTRIBUTION</p><h2>{zh ? '继续阅读源码与设计。' : 'Explore the source and design.'}</h2><p>{zh ? '页面资料固定于 v0.1.0-preview；该 tag 与运行包的构建提交分别记录。项目自有代码为 MIT；演示环境使用 Rob Tuytel / Poly Haven 的 Qwantani（CC0），第三方素材保留各自许可。' : 'Sources are pinned to v0.1.0-preview; the tag and runtime build commit are tracked separately. Project-owned code is MIT; the demo environment uses Qwantani by Rob Tuytel / Poly Haven (CC0). Third-party assets retain their own licenses.'}</p><p><a href={lumabough.source+'assets/LICENSES.md'}>{zh ? '素材署名与许可' : 'Asset attribution and licenses'}</a> · <a href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/README.md'}>{zh ? '证据索引' : 'Evidence index'}</a></p></div><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.release}>{zh ? '下载公开预览版' : 'Download the public preview'} ↗</a></section>
</Layout>
